# Android bounded wide branch slot patcher
# Input first byte is bounded slot count
# Then wide paired branch words and their zero status
# Then precisely count times forty eight template bytes
# All branch word replacement occurs in this Brainfuck program
# Match positions are one based and validated upstream
# Tape table contains seventy four slots with eight cells each
# Marker cells permit returning to the start of the table
# Output contains patched slots followed by two zero bytes
# This stage trusts the input frame produced by prior BF stages
